{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "name": "Plucked Strings",
  "settings": {
    "sample_rate": 48000,
    "length": 20.0,
    "seed": 5,
    "block_size": 256,
    "tempo": [
      {
        "beat": 0.0,
        "bpm": 100.0,
        "time_sig": [
          4,
          4
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "graph": {
    "nodes": [
      {
        "id": "c1",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "A plucked string built from parts, in tune, in a hall. Press Space to play.\n\nEach pluck is a 4 ms burst of noise into a loop: a Delay as long as one cycle of the note, a lowpass that softens every trip round, and a Gain just under 0 dB. The Feedback node closing the loop is set to one sample (Node tab: Delay round the loop), so the loop runs one sample at a time and is exactly as long as the Delay plus one sample: the string plays in tune at any buffer size. With a one-block Feedback it would play flat by a buffer's worth."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            -360.0
          ],
          "size": [
            820.0,
            176.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "1",
        "kind": "clock",
        "params": {
          "duty": 0.5,
          "interval": 0.5
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Eighths"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "2",
        "kind": "random",
        "params": {
          "max": 74.0,
          "min": 45.0
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            280.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Pick a note"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "3",
        "kind": "scale_quantize",
        "params": {
          "root": "D",
          "scale": "dorian"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            560.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Snap to D dorian"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "4",
        "kind": "convert",
        "params": {
          "op": "note_to_hz"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            840.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Note to Hz"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "5",
        "kind": "math",
        "params": {
          "a": 1.0,
          "op": "divide"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1120.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "One cycle"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "6",
        "kind": "math",
        "params": {
          "op": "subtract"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1400.0,
            0.0
          ],
          "label": "Less one sample"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "7",
        "kind": "info",
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            840.0,
            260.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "8",
        "kind": "math",
        "params": {
          "a": 1.0,
          "op": "divide"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1120.0,
            260.0
          ],
          "label": "One sample"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "c2",
        "kind": "comment",
        "config": {
          "text": "The Delay time is one cycle of the note (1 / frequency) less one sample, the sample the Feedback node adds. Info gives the sample rate, so it stays in tune at 44.1 or 96 kHz too. The lowpass adds a little delay of its own, so the string sits a few cents flat."
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            1400.0,
            200.0
          ],
          "size": [
            560.0,
            110.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "9",
        "kind": "noise",
        "params": {
          "gain": -3.0
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            560.0
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "10",
        "kind": "adsr",
        "params": {
          "attack": 0.0,
          "curve": "linear",
          "decay": 0.004,
          "release": 0.0,
          "sustain": 0.0
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            0.0,
            820.0
          ],
          "label": "Pluck"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "11",
        "kind": "math",
        "params": {
          "op": "multiply"
        },
        "ui": {
          "pos": [
            280.0,
            680.0
          ],
          "label": "Noise burst"
        }
      },
      {
        "id": "12",
        "kind": "mix",
